 is my final amount: 50,719, 66,601 or 66,280","'15,794 ₪ מהם חוזרים', back to whom, and when?","Hatched pink bit on the bars and the red 'לפני 6 שנים: מס'. I guessed it means the tax","'מחושב את האחוזים לפי 15,712 ₪', a limit I didn't get","'אחרי דמי ניהול' under the return bar","'מסלול כללי', 'אג\"ח ממשלתית צמודה'","'עד 25% מהחלק שמעל האינפלציה'"],"not_found":["One clear shekel figure for what I get after 6 years, written on the bar","A simple date / 'you can withdraw on year X' line for my own case"],"findings":[{"what":"The calculator opens on 5 years, the bad tax year, instead of 6. So the first scary number is almost 30k going to tax.","where":"Calculator chart / paragraph under bar chart"},{"what":"Only the 'הפקדתם' bar has a shekel figure. 'נשאר בידיים' has no number on it.","where":"Waterfall bar chart"},{"what":"Too many shekel figures in one paragraph (50,719 / 29,768 / 15,794). I can't tell what I end up with.","where":"Text under bar chart"},{"what":"The 66,601–66,280 range sits at the far left end of a long fees line. Easy to miss or misread.","where":"Last paragraph in calculator section"},{"what":"Salary field wants gross. I only know my net.","where":"משכורת ברוטו בחודש"},{"what":"Orange '47%' warning is scary and I don't know if it hits me.","where":"מיסוי section"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1899,"cache_read_input_tokens":15899,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1899},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d2fe01c8-e238-401d-9485-20d68977b5d4","uuid":"380baa82-7920-48dd-a862-20711cd7527d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:30:16.742Z","request_id":"req_011CgkeiLAP3Y2tTQ9KpYGVT","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01ETyHg43GG74A9w